                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 13837/9.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dodge to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">San
                                Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-06-09"><hi rendition="#italic">June 9,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Bailey and <hi rendition="#italic">Goldsboro</hi> will be conveyed to Puerto
                    Cortes.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dodge.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
